      "raw": "[quote=\"Silverleaf\"]\n\nI'd be interested to hear from someone official if playtesting status will be available some time soon-ish, since my awesome boyfriend has offered to pay for it for me (as a belated birthday present) as soon as it is.\n\n[/quote]\n\nall our pt forums are closed at the moment, excepp gsf. but you can try emailing one of the Three to see if you can purchase it out of season as it were. beware of vengeance spoilers :p\n\ni know in the past others have gotten playtesting status when it wasnt offered, but those may have been limited time things. at the very least theyll tell you when its next open",
